    "_readme": "Every assumption behind the theatrical profit estimate. Edit, then rerun `python build_dashboard.py` (no re-ingest needed). Rates are fractions of box office gross; money is in US dollars.",
    "rental_rates": {
      "_readme": "Studio share of gross ('rentals'). international_ex_china and china apply only to films whose data includes a China split (china_gross). Everything else gets international_blended on all international gross. worldwide_only applies when a film has a worldwide figure but no domestic/international split.",
